OL,3,GNEWSAKey findings from Lucy Letby
OL,4,AThirlwall Inquiry
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe inquiry into how serial killer Lucy
OL,7,FLetby was able to murder babies at the
OL,8,FCountess of Chester hospital has
OL,9,Fdelivered its findings, describing a
OL,10,F"complete failure" to protect infants
OL,11,Ffrom harm.
OL,13,FAfter hearing from more than 130
OL,14,Fwitnesses, and considering 400
OL,15,Fstatements over six months, the
OL,16,FThirlwall Inquiry report was published
OL,17,Fearlier at Liverpool Town Hall.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,406,400,260,160,0,100
