OL,3,GNEWSAKey findings from Lucy Letby
OL,4,AThirlwall Inquiry
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt was launched in September 2024,
OL,7,Fafter Letby was convicted of murdering
OL,8,Fseven babies and attempting to murder
OL,9,Fseven others - one of whom she
OL,10,Fattempted to kill twice.
OL,12,FBelow are the key findings from Lady
OL,13,FJustice Thirlwall's report, which ran
OL,14,Fto more than 1,100 pages over three
OL,15,Fvolumes.
